{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474020/extras/035f1aa7678ca6e4fe656ac64dee6f96.avif?t=1771807039\" width=1102 height=311 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474020/extras/c9bb528f85c10eee10bbf2582b5e5d2a.poster.avif?t=1771807039\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474020/extras/c9bb528f85c10eee10bbf2582b5e5d2a.webm?t=1771807039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474020/extras/c9bb528f85c10eee10bbf2582b5e5d2a.mp4?t=1771807039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against your classmates in a duel in The Amazing Crackpots Club! Use spells, potions and magical artifacts to destroy your opponents' giant potion flask, while protecting your own! Test your skills in either 1v1 or 2v2 matches in this frantic Dueling Sport, in both local and online game modes! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474020/extras/c767bdde8038f0fe36524fbbadbf144b.avif?t=1771807039\" width=1102 height=311 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474020/extras/1ba42cb460be59076e338e9a1b7de9f2.avif?t=1771807039\" width=1213 height=407 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique <strong>STORY MODE</strong> where you can truly meet each member of the club!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create profiles to track your records, and make your own <strong>CUSTOM COLOR PALETTES</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and save your own unique <strong>CUSTOM RULESETS</strong> to have full control over the match! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the basics in the <strong>TUTORIAL</strong>, or try out new strategies in <strong>TRAINING MODE</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your abilities against friends with the <strong>ONLINE LOBBIES</strong>!.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 lovingly-animated characters with unique spells, abilities and play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated support for <strong>GAMEPAD</strong> and <strong>KEYBOARD</strong> controls!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474020/extras/228d46473eaeaa3b0af48fc4eece20e0.avif?t=1771807039\" width=1102 height=311 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474020/extras/3c6f0a1e7df33862b290ae2faa665bc6.poster.avif?t=1771807039\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474020/extras/3c6f0a1e7df33862b290ae2faa665bc6.webm?t=1771807039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474020/extras/3c6f0a1e7df33862b290ae2faa665bc6.mp4?t=1771807039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your beautifully-animated club member, and master their magical skills to defeat the opposition! Every mage shares the same four ability types, but they all put their own spin into it. Find their own unique strategies to come out on top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474020/extras/7fd689e1fa77a40adee99ccdf6ef848b.avif?t=1771807039\" width=1132 height=291 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A confident, reckless, but still friendly wizard-in-training that calls upon the power of the stars with the sheer force of his will! Rigel is an easy-to-learn, hard-to-master character that excels at speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474020/extras/966069679372c0e302eb1663ebdb8248.avif?t=1771807039\" width=1132 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sarah \u201cSadie\u201d Lilianne Millicent is an expert in Space-Time manipulation, and has achieved such mastery that she can duel without even looking up from her books.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474020/extras/a330633e122fb942aedfb7212defde8c.avif?t=1771807039\" width=1132 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Hyperactive and fun-loving giant sentient moth that is obsessed with anything shiny. Mothilda uses her magic to summon special (and very shiny) glitter dust clouds she uses as shields. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474020/extras/520ab81430c8a289d08ecb46fa627c10.avif?t=1771807039\" width=1132 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A super friendly and hyper positive minotaur who thinks that the best magic is a healthy body! Mooscles doesn\u2019t have the best mobility, and his abilities have limited use, but his large body covers a wide area, letting him reach bullets very easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474020/extras/af4cb56e917079461f78bfded38ecc37.avif?t=1771807039\" width=1132 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teacher at the prestigious Abracavial Academy of Actual Witchcraft, Breezedemus is a graceful and fabulous master of wind magic, which he uses to defeat his opponents in style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474020/extras/83e5539b4ec98404ba070270a369c63a.avif?t=1771807039\" width=1132 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daughter of the evil queen of frost, Moranna dreams of world domination, and might just have the power to succeed! Her Ice magic lets her freeze bullets and even other duelists, and unlike the rest of the cast, she flies freely across the arena without the need of a jump!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474020/extras/6c5bb5a2130cef0982dc820477a8e42c.avif?t=1771807039\" width=1132 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interchange student from a faraway land, Kiyumi is a gentle half-fox spirit wrangler who commands the not-so-gentle spirit, Kitsuro, who probably wants you dead. You control Kiyumi directly, while you command Kitsuro with her Strike to go after distant bullets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474020/extras/62d7ba196c710f972a334983290a7cc5.avif?t=1771807039\" width=1132 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An even cooler reflection of Rigel, accidentally created by a magical mirror. Betel G plays like a heavier version of Rigel with similar abilities, with some unique twists of his own! Hit bullets with the tip of his wand to give them a speed boost!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474020/extras/00ff88e8805bdd8e72e6be47d6e42e30.avif?t=1771807039\" width=1106 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wandit, the headless dog, is a completely normal dog that stole one of the most powerful wands in the world, thinking it was just a chew toy. Move his body like you would any other character, and control his head separately using his Special Move!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"ARE YOU PROUD OF ME DAD?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2474020/df56efdf0fb46b9278e15121293ad0a90cf5c7df.jpg"},{"name":"Book Club","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2474020/7a219279ccbe497717c6f97fb263a3688cd081d6.jpg"},{"name":"I Glitter, Therefore I Am","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2474020/8f45e51be6a4fc5f859b0de4226f4e33e662b181.jpg"},{"name":"Gym Membership","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2474020/4226f14fc6cb90d968e84c7dc021abec91e847f1.jpg"},{"name":"Stylish Escapee","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2474020/45b5a569f78030915cc0f1d82d139a053de0f3c3.jpg"},{"name":"Model Student","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2474020/a22bb8475684d6fc197c0ee88acc22342fae69da.jpg"},{"name":"Musclevania","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2474020/c7e37b0dc0aa1536dd092cb7e041a2447bf07abc.jpg"},{"name":"Star Struck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2474020/40e004c22718237710cd013bce903f57f3eed270.jpg"},{"name":"Astral Zoomies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2474020/9147bcd1db39eb16097de3257bfc8adf04833623.jpg"},{"name":"Throwing Caution to the Wind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2474020/2387260c92efbe2737d86dbddc1412acb857629e.jpg"}],"total":49},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2474020?t=1771807039","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771807039","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474020/23cc028e0a1f094063cf22d764404236d9bb6b1d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771807039","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474020/23cc028e0a1f094063cf22d764404236d9bb6b1d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771807039","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2606870,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474020/extras/035f1aa7678ca6e4fe656ac64dee6f96.avif?t=1771807039\" width=1102 height=311 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cl